{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.toru.wari",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她盯着账单不动",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.toru.wari",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.toru.wari",
    "idolId": "toru",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——所以。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "个人课会增加，但也要和学业平衡。觉得辛苦就跟我商量。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——手机可以放下了哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "好——，抱歉——",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——樋口发来了消息。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……可能是同一件事。全体课的时间也一起调。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这样啊。嗯，我明白了。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，那把那个喝完就走吧——我去结账。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "啊……今天也这样吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "怎么说呢，是不是一直都让你请客？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，不是……这个算经费。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……诶，嗯。算经费也是——",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "每次都让你请啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯，所以说不是请客……——",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "也不能在路边开会……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且正好是吃饭的时间，总不能让我重要的偶像饿着。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "啊——……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "偶像啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——感觉就是被请客了啊，怎么说。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？是吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "今天我做的那点事，对不上吧——",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "对上『清爽萝卜泥汉堡肉和炸牡蛎套餐』的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——不是……",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯，也是……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这里就 AA 吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……透……！？",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "等一下……！",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "不用在意！",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "不、不行……！",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，那个……透的心情，确实我也觉得有道理。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但是，AA 就正确吗，我也不觉得。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……是吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。如果透和我只是私人出来玩，那请客也好被请也好、AA 也好，都可以。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "但现在，是工作的时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "啊——……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "所以，就是我没做好工作啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，没有那种事。今天听你说话就是工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，课程的事你明白了的话，就辛苦了！1,373 日元，让我付吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "109"
      },
      "109": {
        "id": "109",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "这样啊——……嗯。我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "110"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "那，下次 AA 哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼。",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呐。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……诶，可是，我会在意的。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……该怎么说呢——",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "或者说，不能请客真是抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……所以说——",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——嗯，那你就在意吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个，在意钱的事……那就在下次课上，把今天的份还给我。",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『清爽萝卜泥汉堡肉和炸牡蛎套餐』的热量，好好消耗掉，加油！",
        "nextNodeId": "128"
      },
      "128": {
        "id": "128",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——啊——……",
        "nextNodeId": "129"
      },
      "129": {
        "id": "129",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，这样啊，嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "130"
      },
      "130": {
        "id": "130",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……899 千卡。",
        "nextNodeId": "131"
      },
      "131": {
        "id": "131",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "可能，挺辛苦的。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……抱歉，那个——",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "透的心情，我很高兴。你有在想，工作要好好拿出成果。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶，嗯……不太懂。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是，我很高兴。不过——",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我不想变成 AA 了就结束了。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。我不觉得我和你是靠钱、靠饭连着的。",
        "nextNodeId": "148"
      },
      "148": {
        "id": "148",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，可以的。透要是那样想着要努力，那就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "149"
      },
      "149": {
        "id": "149",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……这样啊。呼，没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "150"
      },
      "150": {
        "id": "150",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "我们，是比炸牡蛎和汉堡肉更深的联系。"
      }
    }
  },
